                    "id": "levelled_description_eacafcca933c",
                    "level": {
                      "value": 4
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "Your time gossiping in fashionable salons keeps you informed on every topic. You are trained in Gossip Lore, a special Lore skill that can be used only to Recall Knowledge, but on any topic. If you fail a check to Recall Knowledge with Gossip Lore, you get the effects of the Dubious Knowledge skill feat (Core Rulebook 260)\n\nIf you have legendary proficiency in Society, you gain expert proficiency in Gossip Lore, but you can't increase your proficiency rank in Gossip Lore by any other means."
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
